### Correct redirect paths by file location

| From | To login | To admin panel | To dashboard |
|---|---|---|---|
| `dashboards/*.html` | `../index.html` | `admin.html` | `dashboard.html` |
| `dashboards/admin/*.html` | `../../index.html` | `../admin.html` | `../dashboard.html` |
| Root files (index, reset, signup) | — | `dashboards/admin.html` | `dashboards/dashboard.html` |

